  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "According to Stefan's law\n$$\nE=\\sigma T^4\n$$\nHeat radiated per unit area in 1 hour ( $3600 \\mathrm{~s})$ is\n$$\n=5.7 \\times 10^{-8} \\times(300)^4 \\times 3600=1.7 \\times 10^{10} \\mathrm{~J}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
